  "body": "Enjoy spacious, modern, easy-care living in the sought-after Gulf View Estate. This freshly renovated three-bedroom, three bathroom apartment features a brand-new kitchen, new carpet and painting, complemented by elevated sea views and excellent resident facilities.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n\r\n* 3 double bedrooms \r\n* 3 bathrooms (includes 2-ensuites)\r\n* 2 secure lock-up garages\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living flowing to a balcony with sea views\r\n* Brand-new kitchen, quality cabinetry, stone benchtops and new appliances\r\n* Freshly painted throughout with new carpet\r\n* Sunny living spaces with excellent natural light\r\n* Swimming pool, gym, spa and sauna within the complex\r\n* Easy lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n* Flexible layout for families, working from home or a flatmate to help pay the mortgage\r\n* Walking distance to Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n* Close to Browns Bay, Murrays Bay and North Shore beaches\r\n* Convenient to shops, cafés and everyday amenities\r\n* Easy access to motorways and arterial routes\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms, three bathrooms and two garages, this apartment offers space, flexibility and lifestyle in one appealing package.\r\n\r\nPARKING: Visitor parking available within the complex.\r\nALL AGENTS: Conjunctional sales welcome!\r\n\r\nCall me today to arrange your viewing.",
